    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers present to the market this spacious four bedroom semi-detached home on private cul-de-sac in Dromroe, Rhebogue. The property\r\nhas been freshly renovated with new flooring, carpeting, and painting throughout. This spacious home has accommodation of approximately 128 sq.m. / 1,364 sq.ft overall.  \r\n\r\nOn the ground floor, there is a large kitchen-dining room with double doors opening into a living room with a fireplace. There is a utility room off the kitchen\r\nproviding rear access followed by the garage which can be easily converted into another bedroom. On the first floor there are four bedrooms, three of\r\nwhich are doubles and one with an ensuite. A large family bathroom can be found to the rear. The property is situated on a settled cul de sac avenue\r\nin a well regarded neighbourhood of Dromroe, Rhebogue. This ideal residential location is convenient to the thriving centre of Limerick City (2.5km) the\r\nUniversity of Limerick in Castletroy (2.8km) Limerick College of Art (1.5km) and the landmark Opera Square development on Charlotte Quay (2km). There are also numerous amenities within walking distance including primary and secondary schools, Parkway Shopping Centre, Childers Road Retail Park and local sports facilities.\r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall  - 4.58m x 1.76m\r\nLarge, bright entrance hall connecting to the living room, and kitchen with under stairs storage.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room - 5.56m x 3.06m\r\nLarge, bright kitchen / dining room with views to the rear garden through glass sliding doors. Fitted kitchen with electric hob and integrated appliances.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.57m x 3.77m\r\nBright and spacious reception room located to the front of the property.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 2.66m x 2.09m\r\nFeaturing storage, rear access and access to the garage.\r\n\r\nGarage - 5.20m x 2.68m\r\nCurrently used as storage space, but holds great potential for conversion to another room.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.17m x 3.82m\r\nDouble bedroom featuring an ensuite and fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2,79m x 2.69m\r\nDouble bedroom.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.18m x 2.68m\r\nDouble bedroom.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 2.36m x 2.16m\r\nSingle bedroom.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.17m x 1.78m\r\nLarge primary bathroom with shower, W.H.B. and W.C."
      },
